<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕo</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. n.
		kindr. with Sanscr. mī, to go, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to go, to pass</i>
				(<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quo simul meāris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 4, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in orientem meavisse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					3, 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meantes exercitus terrere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					8, 4, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of inanim. and abstr. things: ita ut
			vix singula meent plaustra, 
			<i><span class="en">Plin. 6,
				14, 17, § 43</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">triremes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sidera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					15, 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sol,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 2, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 3, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vapor per inane vacuum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 151</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spiritus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					3, 5, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anima diversa in membra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					3, 640</span></i>
			.</div>
